<title>The Philippines: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/philippines/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-philippines-2026-10-26T07:58:07.036Z</guid>
<pubDate>Mon, 26 Oct 2026 07:58:07 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Two Philippine Coast Guard bomb experts were wounded in an accidental explosion at their Zamboanga City barracks, and two Coast Guard members were injured in a separate accidental blast in the same city. Chinese carrier and militia vessels were observed transiting near Mindanao and Zamboanga coasts, prompting AFP monitoring of their movements. The Philippines, United States and Japan completed their 22nd multilateral maritime cooperative activity in the West Philippine Sea, reinforcing joint presence there. Taiwan shut schools and grounded flights as Typhoon Champi passed nearby, affecting regional stability. There were 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwAFBVV95cUxQQ21SaVd6bFpsNHBpX0tEUkJGMFR3ZWhmZUZVLTB4OFl0cWlESzRPOEVoZjl6aXU5bkRpU2Z3XzZyRWhYaDNXLTBhWVU4U2xzSDQ0RXVlX2JSaFgyLTQ2ZWotaUQ0cms1alpJWGc2ZE5TVHI2dWowMmQ3Tlo1cEhWVTREQ3ppNURUN1owV0ZEUGRreGxqVHRKTnpUTDJERVowc0x1VGg1NC14Ykw5RnktMzZiRU1EbXhMcmlxWUpBNzQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Washington Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMingFBVV95cUxOWXMtZDlyMHVKdW9ITmdUQ25xZlZDNXd6eDhpNk81ZnhRbFlEVEtoNlBJaTlxTElURDlrdmFyZWpMME5DU2hnSml4b0ZVaFZBOGg3UmZLS3NhYmIwcmxwdnktdWxvVnBnUFJMblhlT2p5OGpMeDJzQl9lZUVaUU9SSDVqZHNmM29Md1I3N3ZYT2lFaHFqSmFKcks0b0Fydw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Inquirer.net&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxOTXNOeHFyY2IzdE0xdFhOSzFmYUVJNlowMjBjRmo4UTJkaVFzbncwWldGd0lxaGx2OGoxdlZYdzFfRDJ1U2g1cEZSWmxwWEVqbHkxODY3bnFpeTRSY21SQkhVNWoyZFJ2TkpJVnFSbDhMQnFwOUxZaXM4djhQeUpMdWtlaFdKT1NMczdfZ1MyQjFabU5FMENPSlM0S0VZSzdz?oc=5&quot;&gt;Manila Bulletin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMigAFBVV95cUxPNkZRM2VIVGppN0J6MW1JSHc1Q1l6VXJ0ZFJ3QWM0Z1d0eW1HUXk5NTFDZk5LTlN4bWtyY2k1T1VvVXJwaW8zZEx2Q1MwM0l